{"seq":1,"slug":"inspection-grading-protocol","title":"检测测试项与分级判定协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/returns-recommerce-refurbishment-resale-circular-economy/inspection-refurb-pipeline/inspection-grading-protocol","wordCount":3064,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"检测测试项与分级判定协议\">检测测试项与分级判定协议</h1><p>一台从德国退回的 iPhone 15 进入深圳翻新仓的检测工位，四分钟里它要回答上百个是非题：屏幕有没有坏点、触控网格断了几条、电池完整容量还剩多少、iCloud 激活锁解没解、有没有进 GSMA 黑名单、主板是不是原厂件。任何一问答错，代价都不是「重测一次」，而是把实际只有 L2 的机器当作 L1 上架，买家二次退货——二次逆向的物流加折损常吃掉首次翻新的全部毛利。本文把这四分钟写成<strong>可复现协议</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-测试项目录与判定协议是两份不同的工件\">核心概念：测试项目录与判定协议是两份不同的工件</h2><p>检测环节最常见的工程失误，是把「检测」和「分级」混成一份文档，结果既无法审计也无法复用。正确的拆法是两个工件：<strong>测试项目录</strong>（test item catalog）与<strong>判定协议</strong>（grading decision protocol）。<strong>测试项</strong>是原子判定单元，必须声明四件事：输入（被测设备的哪一部分状态）、方法（用什么工具、在什么条件下）、判据（pass/fail 或数值阈值）、产出（结构化结果加一份证据）。缺一即不可复现——「检查一下摄像头」不是测试项，「在 5000K 光照下拍标准色卡，自动白平衡偏移不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta E \\le 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>」才是。测试项按后果分两类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>结果形态</th>\n<th>对分级的作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>闸门项 (gating)</td>\n<td>一票否决，fail 直接决定处置路径</td>\n<td>布尔</td>\n<td>绕过分级合成，直接路由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计分项 (scoring)</td>\n<td>结果映射为归一化分数，参与加权</td>\n<td>数值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_j \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8252em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>送入合成引擎生成等级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>判定协议</strong>是「目录 + 闸门清单 + 权重与阈值 + 版本号 + 适用品类」的封装，一份带版本的可执行契约：给定同一台设备与同一版本协议，任何合格检测员或自动测试台都应产出同一结论。测试顺序是成本优化问题：<strong>先跑最便宜且否决力最强的项</strong>——身份与黑名单查询成本近乎为零，却能在所有物理测试前砍掉整批问题机。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[入库登记] --&gt; B[身份与合规闸门]&#10;  B --&gt;|锁机/黑名单/非原装主板| Z[退出分级&lt;br/&gt;拆件/退货/报警]&#10;  B --&gt;|通过| C[功能测试台]&#10;  C --&gt;|fail| M[维修后重测]&#10;  C --&gt;|pass| D[电池与安全测试]&#10;  D --&gt;|安全 fail| Q[隔离处置&lt;br/&gt;不可再售]&#10;  D --&gt;|pass| E[外观检测与留证]&#10;  E --&gt; F[分级合成引擎]&#10;  M --&gt; C&#10;  F --&gt; G[成色等级&lt;br/&gt;+ 证据包 id + 协议版本]\">graph TD\n  A[入库登记] --&gt; B[身份与合规闸门]\n  B --&gt;|锁机/黑名单/非原装主板| Z[退出分级&lt;br/&gt;拆件/退货/报警]\n  B --&gt;|通过| C[功能测试台]\n  C --&gt;|fail| M[维修后重测]\n  C --&gt;|pass| D[电池与安全测试]\n  D --&gt;|安全 fail| Q[隔离处置&lt;br/&gt;不可再售]\n  D --&gt;|pass| E[外观检测与留证]\n  E --&gt; F[分级合成引擎]\n  M --&gt; C\n  F --&gt; G[成色等级&lt;br/&gt;+ 证据包 id + 协议版本]</pre><h2 id=\"身份与合规闸门-一票否决项必须最先跑\">身份与合规闸门：一票否决项必须最先跑</h2><p>合规项回答的是**「这台机器还能不能合法再售」**，而非「它有多新」——外观再完美，只要 iCloud 激活锁未解，它在任何正规渠道都是一块砖。闸门清单包含：序列号 / IMEI / ESN 一致性、GSMA 及运营商黑名单（失窃或未结清设备拒收上报）、激活锁（iCloud / Google FRP）、MDM 企业管控锁、运营商锁，以及非原厂 / 非授权配件识别（主板与部件序列号比对加维修历史，可触发虚假宣传风险）。</p>\n<p>自动化检测服务把这一整组检查压缩成一次扫描：<strong>Phonecheck</strong> 宣称其流水线「一次通过完成 80 项测试与完整运营商历史查询」，覆盖显示、电池健康、摄像头、传感器、按键、蜂窝频段、外观等级、维修历史、锁状态、IMEI 历史与 GSMA 黑名单，并输出被 Back Market、Amazon Renewed 与 eBay Refurbished 认可的 Device History Report（来源：Phonecheck，<a href=\"https://www.phonecheck.com/）——把「卖家自称已检测」升级为「第三方可核验的检测记录」。\">https://www.phonecheck.com/）——把「卖家自称已检测」升级为「第三方可核验的检测记录」。</a></p>\n<p><strong>数据清除也是闸门项，而非收尾动作。</strong> 设备只要落过买家手里就有个人信息，未清除就再售直接构成隐私事件。NIST SP 800-88《媒体消毒指南》定义三个等级——<strong>Clear（清除）</strong>、<strong>Purge（净化）</strong>、<strong>Destroy（销毁）</strong>——Clear 防止常规系统功能与常见恢复工具读取，Purge 则要求媒体离开组织控制前数据无法恢复（来源：NIST SP 800-88 Rev.1，2014 年 12 月发布；Rev.2 已于 2025-09-26 取代 Rev.1）。清除必须是<strong>结果可验证、凭证可归档</strong>的测试项：Phonecheck 声明其擦除流程符合 ADISA Product Claims Tested、按 NIST 800-88 构建，每次产出签名证书与监管链文档；<strong>「清除证书」远比「已恢复出厂设置」可审计</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"功能测试项目录与自动化测试台\">功能测试项目录与自动化测试台</h2><p>功能测试的目标是<strong>去人化</strong>：把「师傅凭手感按一遍」换成脚本化套件，让结果结构化、可统计、可追溯到工位与固件版本。检测台由夹具、执行器（运行测试脚本的工控机或专用盒子）与把结果写回资产记录的报表层组成。功能项目录大致覆盖显示（坏点、色偏、残影）、触控（网格逐点激励定位断线坐标）、影像（标准图卡拍摄加锐度评分）、传感器（已知姿态下比对读数）、无线（屏蔽箱内逐一建立蜂窝、Wi-Fi、蓝牙、NFC、GPS 链路）、生物识别（录入与解锁成功率采样）与接口充电（插拔循环加功率计读数）。关键收益不是速度而是<strong>一致性</strong>：人眼对「轻微可见痕迹」的判断会随疲劳漂移，脚本不会。判据必须写成<strong>可机读的阈值</strong>（如「触控断点数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 且边缘响应延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>50</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 50\\,\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>」）；凡不满足「两个检测员会得到同一结果」的判据，都应改写成样卡或数值阈值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"电池与安全检测-把健康度算成一个可比的数\">电池与安全检测：把健康度算成一个可比的数</h2><p>电池是二手电子里<strong>唯一被普遍量化</strong>的功能维度：它既高度衰减、又直接影响体验，且有明确物理定义可测。核心指标是<strong>健康状态</strong>（State of Health）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>full</mtext></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rated</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SOH = \\frac{C_{\\text{full}}}{C_{\\text{rated}}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rated</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">full</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>full</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{full}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">full</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是当前完整充电容量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rated</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{rated}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rated</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是出厂额定容量。三条互补测法：<strong>读 BMS 计数</strong>、<strong>主观测</strong>（受控负载下测实际放电容量，最准但耗时）、<strong>推理法</strong>（用内阻、充电曲线拐点推断，快但误差大）；流水线以 BMS 读数为主、抽检放电复核为辅。阈值锚点必须对齐：iPhone 14 及更早机型设计目标是<strong>500 次完整循环后保持 80% 容量</strong>，iPhone 15 提升到 <strong>1000 次循环保持 80%</strong>（来源：Apple 支持文档，<a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/101575）；二手行业普遍以\">https://support.apple.com/en-us/101575）；二手行业普遍以</a> <strong>80% 作为功能分界线</strong>，低于此线应走换电池翻新或降级（来源：Wikipedia「Refurbishment (electronics)」对 CTIA 无线设备分级尺度及行业惯例的综述）。而欧盟 <strong>电池法规 (EU) 2023/1542</strong> 口径更高：把「再制造」定义为恢复到<strong>原额定容量至少 90%</strong>，并要求含电池管理系统的 LMT、电动车与 2 kWh 以上工业电池自 <strong>2027 年 2 月 18 日</strong>起提供电子电池记录（电池护照），SOH 属于其动态数据（来源：Regulation (EU) 2023/1542；Battery Passport 综述，<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battery_passport）。安全项只能闸门化：电池鼓包、异常发热、充电温度超限、外壳可见变形，命中任一即进入**隔离区**单独处置，判据应是绝对阈值（如「充电中表面温升超过\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battery_passport）。安全项只能闸门化：电池鼓包、异常发热、充电温度超限、外壳可见变形，命中任一即进入**隔离区**单独处置，判据应是绝对阈值（如「充电中表面温升超过</a> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow></mrow><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∘</mo></msup><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\,^{\\circ}\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span> 即判 fail」）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"外观检测与留证-sop-让-轻微痕迹-变成可复检的证据\">外观检测与留证 SOP：让「轻微痕迹」变成可复检的证据</h2><p>外观是唯一无法自动化的维度，也正因如此最容易失控。把它变成可复现测试项的办法是<strong>标准化物理条件 + 结构化缺陷编码</strong>。标准化条件锁定三件事：<strong>光照</strong>（固定色温光照箱，常用 5000K–6500K 接近 D65 的均匀漫射光，避免顶灯直射让划痕消失或放大）、<strong>观察距离与角度</strong>、<strong>参照样卡</strong>（每个等级一组实物标样）——改用合格样卡通常是提升检测员一致率最快、最便宜的手段。缺陷要编码成四元组：<strong>位置</strong>（九宫格或坐标分区）、<strong>类型</strong>（划痕/凹陷/裂纹/变色/缺件）、<strong>尺寸</strong>（以毫米计）、<strong>深度</strong>（仅伤涂层 / 伤基材 / 结构性）；同样一条「长 12 mm 的浅划痕」，落在屏幕正中央与边框背面，对成色的影响完全不同。<strong>证据链是外观检测的交付物</strong>：结论不是等级本身，而是「等级 + 与之绑定持久化的证据包」，含缺陷位置图与带标尺照片——退货再流通最大的隐性成本不是分级本身，而是<strong>分级结论被推翻后的二次处理</strong>。外观权重与阈值定义见 <code>../1_recommerce-model-graded-condition/2_graded-condition-taxonomy.md</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"判定协议-闸门-加权合成与版本化\">判定协议：闸门、加权合成与版本化</h2><p>所有测试项跑完，协议先<strong>分离两类结果</strong>：归集所有闸门项的布尔输出，任一 fail 就直接路由到处置路径，不进入分级合成；闸门全过后，才把计分项的归一化分数喂给合成引擎。合成引擎通常是一个加权线性模型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = \\sum_{j} w_j x_j, \\qquad \\sum_j w_j = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_j \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8252em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 个计分维度的归一化得分（0 表示全新，1 表示报废），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该维度权重；再由阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{t_1 &gt; t_2 &gt; \\dots &gt; t_n\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><